        <content type="html" xml:base="https://daveads.github.io/writing/computer-science-resources/">&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I love this particual line made by &lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alan_Kay&quot;&gt;Alan kay&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;cite&gt;At some age you need to take responsibility for your own education&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CS Resources &amp;amp;&amp;amp; important articles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;cs-curriculum&quot;&gt;CS Curriculum&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/electrical-engineering-and-computer-science/&quot;&gt;MIT OPEN COURSE WARE EE &amp;amp; CS courses&lt;/a&gt; IMP 6-2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;http://catalog.mit.edu/degree-charts/computer-science-engineering-course-6-3/&quot;&gt;For a more direct Cs majors&lt;/a&gt; chart 6-3&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ossu/computer-science&quot;&gt;Open Source Society University&lt;/a&gt; self-taught education in Computer Science&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://functionalcs.github.io/curriculum/&quot;&gt;A Self-Learning, Modern Computer Science Curriculum&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/mvillaloboz/open-source-cs-degree&quot;&gt;open-source-cs-degree&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;http://matt.might.net/articles/what-cs-majors-should-know/&quot;&gt;What CS Major Should Know&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;others&quot;&gt;OTHERS&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/mathematics/&quot;&gt;Mit math courses&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/physics/&quot;&gt;Mit physcis Courses&lt;/a&gt; courses of interest&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://www.edx.org/&quot;&gt;Edx&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coursera.org/&quot;&gt;Coursera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/mtdvio/every-programmer-should-know&quot;&gt;Every Programmer Should Know&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/datasciencemasters/go&quot;&gt;The Open Source Date Science masters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/humanwhocodes/computer-science-in-javascript&quot;&gt;computer science in javascript&lt;/a&gt; collection of classic computer science paradigms, algorithms, and approaches written in JavaScript&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://teachyourselfcs.com/&quot;&gt;Teach yourself computer science&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://www.nand2tetris.org/&quot;&gt;Nand to Tetris&lt;/a&gt; Building a Modern Computer From First Principles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;cs-coursers&quot;&gt;CS COURSERS&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Developer-Y/cs-video-courses&quot;&gt;List of Computer Science courses with video lectures&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/P1xt/p1xt-guides&quot;&gt;Programming curricula&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/prakhar1989/awesome-courses&quot;&gt;Awesome CS Courses&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://bootcamp.berkeley.edu/coding/&quot;&gt;Berkeley Coding Boot Camp&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;alogrithms&quot;&gt;Alogrithms&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/keon/algorithms&quot;&gt;algorithms&lt;/a&gt; algorithms using python&lt;/p&gt;
