&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;important&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external&quot; rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;http://norvig.com/21-days.html&quot;&gt;Teach Yourself Programming in Ten Years&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/writing/interesting-programming-and-cs-books.html&quot;&gt;Books&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</content>
        
